{"id":"vod_sn_38540","vodId":"38540","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"夏之岚","name_cn":"夏之岚","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/bc8598b99836abe1d41bfe9a9583c418.jpg"},"summary":"八坂一（三瓶由步子 配音）是一个普通的少年，每年夏天，他都要借宿于祖父位于海边的老宅。这一年是注定不平凡的一年，在方舟咖啡馆里，阿一遇见了令他一见钟情的女子——岚山岚（白石凉子 配音）。岚亮丽的外表和开朗的性格吸引着阿一的注意，但更重要的是，当阿一和岚的双手相触之时，他们居然穿越回了古代的日本！　　原来，岚的实体在二战时期早已死去，现在出现在阿一面前的，是一种被称之为“幽灵体”的存在，当幽灵体遇到了特定的人物时，便能够激活其穿越时间的能力。在咖啡馆里，越来越多的幽灵体聚集在了一起，在她们对于往昔的思念和忧伤之中，岚和阿一发展出了一段超越了时空的爱恋。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:02:27","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TbBWYMtuma1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mEBZX7hzVu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0nDMzLWAz41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TW9fa9MmcW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uyYxGKyHuF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kGDKPMfPLt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YWgt0DVcQu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9dZeB8Drk61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wWWKe9qMus1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dQKw0ADd1V1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/A26T16fteY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/biSyshyr2g1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/32EAz8d5Hz1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:57.754Z"}